{"id":"s0355","kind":"story","t":"Tell me...now! Colours","lv":1,"credits":{"text":"Madhav Chavan","art":"Rijuta Ghate","tr":"","faBy":"Claude"},"lic":"CC BY","src":"https://github.com/global-asp/asp-source/blob/master/en/0355_tell-me.now-colours.md","from":"African Storybook","pages":[{"p":["Why is the sky blue?"],"fa":"چرا آسمان آبی است؟","faC":1},{"p":["It is not always blue. Is it?"],"fa":"همیشه که آبی نیست. هست؟","faC":1},{"p":["Why are leaves green?"],"fa":"چرا برگ‌ها سبزند؟","faC":1},{"p":["They are not always green. Are they?"],"fa":"همیشه که سبز نیستند. هستند؟","faC":1},{"p":["Why are bananas yellow?"],"fa":"چرا موزها زردند؟","faC":1},{"p":["Ripe bananas are yellow. Unripe bananas are green."],"fa":"موزهای رسیده زردند. موزهای نارس سبزند.","faC":1},{"p":["Why are umbrellas black?"],"fa":"چرا چترها سیاه‌اند؟","faC":1},{"p":["Not all umbrellas are black."],"fa":"همه‌ی چترها سیاه نیستند.","faC":1},{"p":["Why is blood red?"],"fa":"چرا خون قرمز است؟","faC":1},{"p":["There is iron in the blood. That makes it red."],"fa":"در خون آهن هست. همین آن را قرمز می‌کند.","faC":1},{"p":["Why is salt white?"],"fa":"چرا نمک سفید است؟","faC":1},{"p":["I don't know!"],"fa":"نمی‌دانم!","faC":1}]}